{"id": "86181", "name": "הוצאת גורם משותף – av² + bv (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Factorise the following:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> The common factor is the highest common factor (hcf) of the coefficients times every letter that appears in all the terms, each with its lowest power. Divide every term by it, write the quotients in a bracket, and check by expanding.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The common factor</b><br>The terms are \\({{CT:1}}\\) and \\({{CT:2}}\\). The coefficients \\({{CT:3}}\\) and \\({{CT:4}}\\) are consecutive whole numbers, so their hcf is \\(1\\): there is no numerical common factor. The letter \\({{CT:5}}\\) appears in both terms, with powers \\(2\\) and \\(1\\); the lowest power is \\(1\\). So the common factor is<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:5}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Dividing each term by the common factor</b><br>Each term divided by \\({{CT:5}}\\):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{{{CT:1}}}{{{CT:5}}}={{CT:6}},\\qquad \\frac{{{CT:2}}}{{{CT:5}}}={{CT:4}} \\]</p>The quotients go into the bracket:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}={{CT:5}}\\left({{CT:7}}\\right) \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Check and answer</b><br>Check by expanding the brackets:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:5}}\\cdot {{CT:6}}+{{CT:5}}\\cdot {{CT:4}}={{CT:0}} \\]</p>So the factorised form is<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}={{CT:8}}. \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "factor", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "FacForm", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["cf1", "cf2", "ta", "v"], "nvariants": 24}